# 📖 TOEFL Reading - Day 11

## Passage

Communication is an essential part of human society. People interact with one another to exchange information, express emotions, and solve problems. Effective communication improves relationships and teamwork.

---

## Question

According to the passage, what is one benefit of effective communication?

A. It reduces learning.

B. It improves relationships.

C. It prevents interaction.

D. It replaces teamwork.

---

## Answer

B. It improves relationships.

---

## Key Vocabulary

- communication = 의사소통
- exchange = 교환하다
- express = 표현하다
- relationship = 관계
